WEBVTT

00:01:31.520 --> 00:01:36.530
Rebel 11: The Murakumo Awakens

00:01:39.490 --> 00:01:40.830
You piece of shit...

00:01:44.250 --> 00:01:46.620
Was that... a heartbeat?

00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:49.540
Is it the Black Beast's heartbeat?

00:01:50.380 --> 00:01:54.090
Your goal was to revive the Black Beast?!

00:01:54.260 --> 00:01:56.720
Huh? The Black Beast?

00:01:56.720 --> 00:02:00.800
Why would I go through all this to ressuscitate that failure?

00:02:01.600 --> 00:02:02.760
That failure?

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:05.470
Well, you see...

00:02:06.060 --> 00:02:08.770
That's a Cauldron that went haywire.

00:02:11.560 --> 00:02:14.230
Well, we've still got a bit of time here.

00:02:14.610 --> 00:02:17.360
I'll be extra nice and tell you about it.

00:02:17.820 --> 00:02:21.320
In fact, this is something you need to freakin' know.

00:02:21.320 --> 00:02:22.530
What do you mean?

00:02:22.530 --> 00:02:23.950
Just listen.

00:02:24.490 --> 00:02:26.410
Once upon a time,

00:02:26.410 --> 00:02:31.130
mankind discovered a gateway that led to a world that we call the Boundary.

00:02:31.630 --> 00:02:34.420
It's what we today we refer to as a Cauldron.

00:02:35.210 --> 00:02:38.300
The Boundary was filled with seithr.

00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:43.260
Seithr, the source of power that every last damn one of you use now.

00:02:43.600 --> 00:02:46.390
Now, Rags, kiddo, time for a question.

00:02:46.390 --> 00:02:48.640
What is seithr?

00:02:48.640 --> 00:02:49.310
What?

00:02:49.690 --> 00:02:51.350
Okay, time's up!

00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:56.570
The answer is: it's an artifically created particulate program!

00:02:56.860 --> 00:03:00.240
Not only that, but it's the substance that this entire world is made of.

00:03:00.990 --> 00:03:06.620
And mankind learned of the existence of an absolute observer,

00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:09.410
the Master Unit, which could freely control that seithr.

00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:12.630
Desiring the power of the Master Unit,

00:03:12.630 --> 00:03:15.540
mankind created the Boundary Interface Prime Field Device

00:03:15.540 --> 00:03:19.550
and successfully interfaced with the Master Unit.

00:03:19.920 --> 00:03:23.340
But the thing is, the First Prime Field that interfaced with the Master Unit

00:03:23.340 --> 00:03:27.890
obtained the Power of the Eye and became an observer.

00:03:29.060 --> 00:03:31.730
That's some serious crazy power, man.

00:03:32.520 --> 00:03:39.110
I mean, it lets you overwrite every event out there to suit your needs.

00:03:39.780 --> 00:03:42.610
Fearing the Power of the Eye,

00:03:42.610 --> 00:03:45.820
the First Prime Field's developers dumped it into the Boundary.

00:03:46.740 --> 00:03:50.080
The faster you get rid of dangerous toys the better, right?

00:03:50.620 --> 00:03:56.500
But the data left behind by the First Prime Field was just fantastic stuff.

00:03:57.800 --> 00:04:05.470
So mankind thought to use that data to control events for themselves!

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:09.970
And what they created was the Takamagahara System.

00:04:10.930 --> 00:04:12.180
You get it?

00:04:12.520 --> 00:04:14.940
Mankind created a god.

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:18.650
But hey, there's no need for two gods.

00:04:19.020 --> 00:04:22.780
Naturaly, the Takamagahara System came to the same conclusion.

00:04:23.200 --> 00:04:28.120
So, it gave the Boundary Interface Prime Field Device a special task:

00:04:28.370 --> 00:04:32.080
to destroy the other god, the Master Unit.

00:04:33.660 --> 00:04:38.540
Based on the Izayoi, the Anti-Observer Armagus that destroyed the First Prime Field,

00:04:38.540 --> 00:04:41.340
it created the Shinki called the Murakumo.

00:04:41.340 --> 00:04:45.010
But it would be impossible to destroy the Master Unit with that alone.

00:04:45.010 --> 00:04:47.390
Not without the Power of the Azure.

00:04:47.970 --> 00:04:48.800
The Azure...

00:04:49.260 --> 00:04:53.600
Yup, the power at the root of it all, existing deep within the Boundary.

00:04:53.600 --> 00:04:55.810
The power of creation and destruction.

00:04:55.810 --> 00:04:57.770
That's the Azure.

00:04:57.770 --> 00:05:02.940
It was just a tiny smidge, but I was able to extract some of that Power of the Azure.

00:05:02.940 --> 00:05:04.990
And so I made it into something special.

00:05:05.820 --> 00:05:08.820
The Azure Grimoire, the BlazBlue.

00:05:10.660 --> 00:05:16.750
What you have and what I have are both imitations of the true Azure Grimoire. They're fakes.

00:05:17.330 --> 00:05:19.420
Still, while they may both be fake,

00:05:19.420 --> 00:05:23.710
in the hands of different masters, it looks like the disparity in power can get to be pretty big.

00:05:24.550 --> 00:05:29.550
So! When the Azure Grimoire and the Murakumo fail to fuse,

00:05:29.550 --> 00:05:31.060
they go haywire.

00:05:31.060 --> 00:05:33.140
And what came into being as a result of that was...

00:05:33.680 --> 00:05:35.640
...the monster that destroyed everything in its path,

00:05:35.640 --> 00:05:38.190
the devourer of souls...

00:05:38.190 --> 00:05:40.730
The Black Beast.

00:05:41.900 --> 00:05:43.780
Are you serious?

00:05:43.780 --> 00:05:47.150
But see, that girl is different.

00:05:47.150 --> 00:05:50.490
Noel Vermillion has no need of the Azure Grimoire.

00:05:50.490 --> 00:05:53.740
She's a perfect Prime Field, who has the Azure within her.

00:05:54.910 --> 00:05:57.660
Awesome, right? Hilarious, isn't it?

00:05:57.660 --> 00:06:03.090
I mean, that retarded annoying cunt turns out to be quite useful as a Prime Field!

00:06:09.930 --> 00:06:10.720
Noel!

00:06:18.850 --> 00:06:20.650
We're prepped for the transfer.

00:06:32.240 --> 00:06:35.990
Now, time to awaken the Murakumo!

00:06:39.420 --> 00:06:40.960
This world is all lies.

00:06:40.960 --> 00:06:44.250
Lies. Lies. Lies. Lies. Lies. Lies.

00:06:44.250 --> 00:06:45.250
It's full of lies!

00:06:45.960 --> 00:06:51.430
So I'll show you the truth known as despair!

00:06:52.760 --> 00:06:55.180
In the name of the Susano'o, I command you.

00:06:55.430 --> 00:06:57.180
Rise, Murakumo...

00:06:57.890 --> 00:07:01.730
Nay, Kusanagi, the God-Killer Sword!

00:07:02.100 --> 00:07:06.440
With that blade, lay waste to every lie there is!

00:07:16.740 --> 00:07:17.790
I hate...

00:07:18.790 --> 00:07:20.790
I hate the world...

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:23.500
I have the Azure!

00:07:25.710 --> 00:07:29.840
Now, try and stop me, Master Unit Amaterasu!

00:07:30.090 --> 00:07:31.050
Noel...

00:07:31.050 --> 00:07:32.630
Hey, Noel!

00:07:33.090 --> 00:07:36.390
I hate... I hate the world...

00:07:37.350 --> 00:07:41.390
How adorable. You're the best sword ever.

00:07:41.390 --> 00:07:46.770
How many times have I stolen this face away from you now, Ragsy?

00:07:48.230 --> 00:07:49.860
I'm going to fucking kill you!

00:07:49.990 --> 00:07:51.070
Ouroboros!

00:07:54.360 --> 00:07:55.320
Damn it...

00:07:55.620 --> 00:07:59.540
Oh? You mad? Are you mad?

00:07:59.540 --> 00:08:03.210
Hey, Kusanagi, you head straight for the Cauldron.

00:08:03.210 --> 00:08:06.630
And go kill Amaterasu for me.

00:08:06.630 --> 00:08:07.540
Roger.

00:08:10.090 --> 00:08:12.170
Wait! Noel, don't go!

00:08:13.880 --> 00:08:16.890
Hey, now, you're bothering the lady, Rags.

00:08:19.140 --> 00:08:20.350
You listen to me, Lambda.

00:08:20.560 --> 00:08:24.190
When that bastard is attacking Ragna the Bloodedge,

00:08:24.190 --> 00:08:28.270
There's bound to be a small opening at some point.

00:08:28.270 --> 00:08:29.820
Aim for that.

00:08:29.820 --> 00:08:33.280
Failure is not an option. You'll only have one chance at this.

00:08:33.280 --> 00:08:34.530
Roger.

00:08:41.040 --> 00:08:43.080
Gate activation confirmed.

00:08:46.580 --> 00:08:50.170
So, you have come, Kusanagi the God-Killer Sword.

00:08:51.760 --> 00:08:56.720
Identified as the Sankishin Unit Susano'o, top priority target for destruction.

00:08:57.220 --> 00:08:59.010
I am the white.

00:08:59.010 --> 00:09:04.020
I wipe the slate of the world clean so that it may begin anew!

00:09:04.430 --> 00:09:06.520
I am Hakumen

00:09:08.020 --> 00:09:09.520
Deploying petals.

00:09:09.520 --> 00:09:11.780
Switching setup to maximize offense.

00:09:11.980 --> 00:09:13.860
The end has come!

00:09:22.290 --> 00:09:26.460
Weak. You're too weak, Rags!

00:09:27.870 --> 00:09:32.460
But man... You're a real pain, Takamagahara.

00:09:32.460 --> 00:09:34.760
Lookin' down at me from your seat in the sky.

00:09:35.220 --> 00:09:36.510
Damn it.

00:09:37.800 --> 00:09:40.350
Even if you cannot win, do not die.

00:09:40.930 --> 00:09:45.310
Sorry, Master. It doesn't look like I can do that...

00:09:47.600 --> 00:09:49.020
I can still keep going.

00:09:49.480 --> 00:09:52.480
Huh, are you running away? Lame.

00:09:53.280 --> 00:09:55.440
I'll play with you, so come at me.

00:09:56.530 --> 00:09:59.240
Don't get cocky.

00:09:59.240 --> 00:10:02.660
The hell d'you say to me, you piece of trash?!

00:10:04.910 --> 00:10:05.790
Not yet.

00:10:08.370 --> 00:10:12.290
I won't let you... I won't let you have your way with Noel.

00:10:12.630 --> 00:10:14.920
I told you, that ain't Noel!

00:10:14.920 --> 00:10:18.050
That's Kusanagi! Just a doll!

00:10:18.050 --> 00:10:19.720
A doll that was <i>built</i>

00:10:20.180 --> 00:10:21.350
Doesn't matter.

00:10:21.350 --> 00:10:22.300
Huh?

00:10:22.300 --> 00:10:25.220
Even so, I decided that I was going to protect her!

00:10:27.270 --> 00:10:29.650
Protect her? How, exactly?

00:10:29.650 --> 00:10:33.190
You're just a little puppy who's all bark and no bite!

00:10:33.400 --> 00:10:36.360
Well, bark all you want, lil' puppy.

00:10:36.360 --> 00:10:41.660
In the end, you haven't managed to protect that dim woman or that infernal vampire!

00:10:42.660 --> 00:10:43.870
What did you do to Rachel?

00:10:44.700 --> 00:10:47.830
She's probably conked out in darkness right about now.

00:10:47.830 --> 00:10:49.370
Bastard!

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:52.130
Not yet, wait.

00:10:58.220 --> 00:11:02.220
Man, I'm just kind of getting bored of bullying you.

00:11:02.220 --> 00:11:04.550
I think it's high time for you to die!

00:11:05.760 --> 00:11:08.230
C'mon, c'mon! Die! Die! Die!

00:11:09.140 --> 00:11:10.270
You nutcase...

00:11:11.520 --> 00:11:12.900
Not yet, Lambda!

00:11:20.950 --> 00:11:21.740
Hey, now, what's this?

00:11:21.740 --> 00:11:23.950
Thinking of begging for your life?

00:11:23.950 --> 00:11:25.120
Shut the hell up.

00:11:25.450 --> 00:11:27.450
I'm never giving up!

00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:33.080
Ragna...

00:11:33.500 --> 00:11:36.800
I'll keep at it to the bitter end!

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:39.380
And the end is now.

00:11:42.180 --> 00:11:44.430
Die for real, Ragna!

00:11:44.430 --> 00:11:45.600
Now!

00:11:48.850 --> 00:11:49.930
Take that!

00:12:03.110 --> 00:12:04.160
What?!

00:12:08.080 --> 00:12:17.880
Lambda...

00:12:22.880 --> 00:12:25.300
Get out of my fucking way!

00:12:33.940 --> 00:12:36.190
Target for destruction, identified.

00:12:36.190 --> 00:12:38.400
Don't Lambda! It's impossible now!

00:12:38.940 --> 00:12:42.150
I goddamn told you that you'd only have one shot at this...

00:12:42.150 --> 00:12:44.070
Why'd you do that?

00:12:44.280 --> 00:12:45.990
Commencing attack.

00:12:45.990 --> 00:12:47.780
Hey! I gave you orders!

00:12:47.780 --> 00:12:53.000
Kokonoe, huh? That dumb cat and her annoying tricks...

00:12:53.000 --> 00:12:56.830
Fine, I'll tear your doll apart then.

00:12:56.830 --> 00:12:59.130
Just like I did with your mother!

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:02.090
Terumi!

00:13:02.260 --> 00:13:04.510
You all can die together!

00:13:04.510 --> 00:13:06.340
Lambda, get back!

00:13:22.610 --> 00:13:23.610
Lambda!

00:13:23.860 --> 00:13:26.150
Kokonoe, do something, now!

00:13:26.150 --> 00:13:27.570
Transfer her or something!

00:13:27.570 --> 00:13:30.280
Hey! Hurry up! Hey!

00:13:30.280 --> 00:13:34.290
It can't be done. She's far beyond any hope of repair.

00:13:34.540 --> 00:13:36.710
It's over for her.

00:13:36.710 --> 00:13:39.460
Don't screw with me! Do something!

00:13:41.170 --> 00:13:43.920
Damn it... Why did you save me?!

00:13:44.970 --> 00:13:45.920
Ragna...

00:13:46.550 --> 00:13:50.890
Oh, Ragna, long time no see.

00:13:51.930 --> 00:13:53.430
Is that Nu?

00:13:53.430 --> 00:13:56.560
Impossible! All past memories have been erased.

00:13:56.560 --> 00:13:58.600
How can she remember Ragna?

00:13:59.150 --> 00:14:02.770
I'm so glad you're here...

00:14:02.770 --> 00:14:07.200
See, for the longest time, I was all alone in the Boundary...

00:14:08.150 --> 00:14:10.820
I was always dreaming of you, Ragna.

00:14:11.490 --> 00:14:15.000
We were someplace where the weather was nice

00:14:15.660 --> 00:14:17.960
and we were taking a stroll together.

00:14:18.870 --> 00:14:23.090
Being surprised... Having fun...

00:14:23.090 --> 00:14:25.090
Experiencing new things...

00:14:26.420 --> 00:14:30.340
There were some things that were a little sad, too.

00:14:33.430 --> 00:14:35.520
Ragna, what's wrong?

00:14:35.520 --> 00:14:36.560
Sorry...

00:14:37.180 --> 00:14:43.110
Hey, I know what this is.

00:14:44.020 --> 00:14:47.190
These are droplets of niceness, right?

00:14:47.940 --> 00:14:51.530
Ragna is nice...

00:14:56.240 --> 00:14:57.700
And warm...

00:14:58.370 --> 00:15:04.960
Ragna and I will be together forever...

00:15:08.260 --> 00:15:09.220
Impossible!

00:15:09.220 --> 00:15:11.550
Has he interfaced with the Idea Engine?

00:15:41.500 --> 00:15:43.920
Is he absorbing it?

00:15:48.670 --> 00:15:50.300
You gotta be kidding...

00:15:50.670 --> 00:15:55.100
Don't you...Don't you go dying for someone like me!

00:15:56.890 --> 00:15:59.310
Aw, you crying? Suck it up, buttercup.

00:16:02.060 --> 00:16:03.730
Is that an imitation event weapon?

00:16:04.270 --> 00:16:05.110
Terumi...

00:16:05.770 --> 00:16:09.480
You asshole... You're never getting away with this!

00:16:09.480 --> 00:16:12.570
Ragna the Bloodedge, connect to the Idea Engine!

00:16:13.410 --> 00:16:14.530
The Idea Engine?

00:16:19.870 --> 00:16:23.460
I already told you it's pointless! What are you, stupid?

00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:29.250
Restriction 666 released.

00:16:29.250 --> 00:16:32.380
Dimensional Interference Field deployed!

00:16:34.470 --> 00:16:38.430
I'll always be with you, Ragna.

00:16:38.430 --> 00:16:40.220
Idea Engine, connect!

00:16:43.480 --> 00:16:46.770
I'll show you the <i>real</i> Power of the Azure!

00:16:47.020 --> 00:16:48.820
Azure Grimoire, activate!

00:16:55.570 --> 00:16:56.360
My power...

00:16:56.700 --> 00:16:59.950
Here goes, you damn viper!

00:17:05.120 --> 00:17:06.040
Wh-What the—

00:17:10.130 --> 00:17:12.380
Terumi!

00:17:15.720 --> 00:17:17.800
Be devoured by darkness!

00:17:34.650 --> 00:17:36.910
This! This! This! This is it!

00:17:36.910 --> 00:17:39.370
This is what I've been looking for!

00:17:42.540 --> 00:17:48.250
All right, Ragna the Bloodedge, come at me!

00:17:48.250 --> 00:17:53.800
Not yet... This isn't enough yet! The boredom is killing me!

00:17:53.800 --> 00:17:58.090
So, c'mon, entertain me!

00:18:03.600 --> 00:18:04.720
The hell is up with you?

00:18:05.560 --> 00:18:07.690
What're you looking down at me for?

00:18:08.060 --> 00:18:10.900
If you're gonna kill me, hurry up and do it...

00:18:16.440 --> 00:18:18.360
H-H-Help!

00:18:19.240 --> 00:18:22.370
The Princess! You've gotta help the Princess!

00:18:22.370 --> 00:18:23.120
Where?

00:18:23.120 --> 00:18:24.290
This way!

00:18:29.210 --> 00:18:31.540
You damn... coward...

00:18:34.960 --> 00:18:37.760
I expected no less of you Kusanagi. You are formidable.

00:18:38.630 --> 00:18:42.680
Damage sustained, insignificant. Resuming combat.

00:18:43.350 --> 00:18:45.270
Event weapon detected.

00:18:46.100 --> 00:18:49.100
You are you Noel Vermillion?

00:18:53.480 --> 00:18:56.900
So, you have awakened to the Power of Order, Jin Kisaragi.

00:18:56.900 --> 00:18:59.650
You are in my way. Move.

00:18:59.650 --> 00:19:01.820
I am going to finish my fight with my brother.

00:19:01.820 --> 00:19:05.330
And I will merely eliminate any and all obstacles that get in my way.

00:19:06.240 --> 00:19:09.290
'Tis not an opponent you able to defeat.

00:19:09.290 --> 00:19:11.370
This is my fight.

00:19:11.580 --> 00:19:13.790
Apparitions of the past need to stay out of this!

00:19:17.510 --> 00:19:20.260
You have become an evil that must be destroyed.

00:19:20.720 --> 00:19:22.300
Yukianesa, activate!

00:19:23.510 --> 00:19:26.890
Target's offense level identified as SS.

00:19:26.890 --> 00:19:29.020
Retain setup for maximized offense.

00:19:32.440 --> 00:19:33.350
So this is the place...

00:19:33.350 --> 00:19:36.320
Hurry up and save the Princess, you slowpoke!

00:19:37.480 --> 00:19:40.900
Hey, goofball, remember that I'm doing you a favor here.

00:19:41.860 --> 00:19:46.080
Well, whatever. I guess I go save that dumb rabbit.

00:20:00.970 --> 00:20:03.220
Who did you call a "dumb rabbit"?

00:20:03.890 --> 00:20:05.470
Who dared utter such vile words?

00:20:05.800 --> 00:20:08.560
Want me to sew his mouth shut so it can never speak again?

00:20:08.560 --> 00:20:11.390
Princess! Nago!

00:20:11.640 --> 00:20:15.230
Honestly. How could you go to such an inferior creature?

00:20:15.230 --> 00:20:17.480
I-I-I didn't! He just did it on his own!

00:20:18.610 --> 00:20:21.780
You've changed somehow.

00:20:21.780 --> 00:20:22.570
Huh?

00:20:22.570 --> 00:20:26.280
Hey, wait! I saved you guys, so the least you could do is thank me!

00:20:26.660 --> 00:20:27.910
Oh, but I have.

00:20:27.910 --> 00:20:28.830
When?!

00:20:29.540 --> 00:20:30.500
Always.

00:20:31.830 --> 00:20:33.710
Let's get going after Noel.

00:20:45.260 --> 00:20:47.390
Target's offense level, declining.

00:20:47.800 --> 00:20:50.770
Resuming combat... Resuming combat...

00:20:52.020 --> 00:20:53.230
Stay out of this!

00:21:03.190 --> 00:21:04.450
The Dark One?

00:21:04.900 --> 00:21:06.910
You're late, Brother...

00:21:07.120 --> 00:21:10.990
Yeah, I was lurking in the shadows, waiting for you to get beat.

00:21:11.950 --> 00:21:14.330
You're terrible, Brother...

00:21:14.580 --> 00:21:16.250
Lets finish this up quickly.

00:21:16.250 --> 00:21:17.920
Of course.

00:21:18.790 --> 00:21:21.710
Target in possession of the Azure Grimoire.

00:21:22.210 --> 00:21:23.050
Noel...

00:21:23.510 --> 00:21:27.090
How could you let yourself be reduced to this crazy, messed up machine!

00:21:27.390 --> 00:21:29.600
You dumbass!

00:23:02.020 --> 00:23:02.860
Ragna!

00:23:03.060 --> 00:23:04.070
Which is which?!

00:23:04.070 --> 00:23:04.690
I'm Lambda.
I'm Nu.

00:23:04.690 --> 00:23:05.400
I'm Mu.
I'm Lambda.

00:23:05.400 --> 00:23:07.740
Episode 12,
"The Price for the Future.

00:23:07.740 --> 00:23:08.990
Who just read the title?!

00:23:08.990 --> 00:23:10.110
Noel!
